   "end": 28.78,
   "text": "Catch it and you have caught a curse. Let it go and you have let go of something precious. That is the man in one line. The revolutionary who did not finish his revolution. The pragmatist who pulled Ghana back from collapse. The strong man who still gave us the constitution, the term limits and the handover that made our democracy. So here is the lesson squad. Anger can diagnose a nation but only a plan can heal it.",
